  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-人群定向、DMP 与 RTA\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"将DMP人群包复制一个，并推送至对应的云图账号内，可在人群模块自定义分析查看和应用（该人群不支持再次推送）。关键配合接口：【获取Access token】、【获取投放账户关联云图账户信息】、【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"dmp.custom_audience.copy\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/copy/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1729365642747908\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要通过该接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"get.advertiser_cloudmap_info\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1729365568399363\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要通过该接口获取推送客户ID（云图虚拟客户ID）\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取投放账户关联云图账户信息\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"此接口的应答字段需要参考该文档的返回码说明\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1729365642747908\",\"title\":\"推送dmp人群包到云图账户\"}",
